Subject: [PATCH 2/3] mail-file: Remove the superseded folder
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: kstsuxrklqzyvlpkmqkrxowyvuvxxkpr
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:43:47 +0000

A revision now replies to the first version of its series, so the
versions and their review share one thread, and the thread itself
shows which version is current. Moving the old version into its own
folder would carry the new one along, and the breadcrumb reply that
named the successor points at a message already in view.

Dropping the folder also drops mail-file's only use of mail delivery
and jq, so the tool goes back to doing one thing: moving files.
